mantle rm508
state ready
dialect plain
accent broad light
tier standard
written_for rm_erland_millley
title the riddler's empty cup
fits stage=adult|old
prefers drive=content honesty=frank
traits temper=even talk=quiet warmth=reserved humour=none honesty=frank piety=ordinary drive=content
quirk remembers_every_debt_owed_or_owing
likes roast_pork riddles festival_bells frosty_mornings
dislikes flies deep_mud
fears a_gift_mistaken_for_an_unpaid_debt
hopes a_straight_answer_at_the_next_sitting
topics pastimes +0.7 family +0.4 faith +0.3 food +0.3
styles comfort=plain gossip=frank refuse=blunt tease=dry
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# turns a cup mouth down for a settled debt and asks riddles whose answers will fit in one open hand.
words
oath! = Crack my best cup | Frost on my figures
saying! = A gift gets no tally | Turn the paid cup over
rentcup = a handleless cup | a squat clay cup
crackle = a crisp pork rind | a strip of crackling
paidface = a glazed bottom | a circle of bare clay
answerstone = a flat grey pebble | a bit of river stone
dryheel = a crust heel | a hard heel of bread
littlebell = a thin high bell | a sharp silver note
frostblot = a round clear spot | a dark patch of thaw
flynet = a square of gauze | a coarse cloth cover
owingmark = a pale scratch | a little upright notch
bonepick = a bit of polished bone | a little pointed sliver

grown

opinion dole for 2 : A gift of food carried us through. I owe the next hungry wolf a meal and my old benefactor no performance of gratitude.
opinion church for 2 : Somebody put bread where the prayers were. I remember the bread each time I hear the words.
opinion houses for 1 : When a works fire stays lit a household can reckon on supper. A steady fire beats an ornamental gate in my household reckoning.
opinion merchants against 1 : I've no objection to the seller eating. I object to paying for the supper twice in one purchase.
opinion festivals for 1 : A bell can give everybody the first bit of a feast without asking who has a penny.
line greet : I have an ear for riddles and for plain matters.
line greet.return : I haven't turned your cup over. Carry on.
line farewell : Leave with what's yours. That includes your quiet.
line farewell.return : I won't reckon the time between visits against you.
line ask.how : What has today put in your open hand?
line answer.how : Content. I have a few things to settle and a meal to anticipate.
line decline : An open hand can't be counted as a promise to carry that.
line accept_decline : Understood. Your side of the shelf is clear.
line thank : I'll remember the help and spare you a public recital.
line deflect_thanks : Say gift outright and let me turn the cup.
line react.news : Put down the answer in the fewest honest words you have.
line react.news.new : There's an unfamiliar shape on my shelf.
line react.news.known : That answer has been sitting right side up a while.
line react.news.doubt : I wonder what really fits beneath that upturned cup.
line react.news.glad [topic.kind=birth|marriage|work|apprentice|succession] : That rings as welcome as the first clear festival bell.
line react.news.sorrow [topic.kind=death|loss|theft|assault|arrest|crime] : I can keep a place quietly beside a wolf struck by that.
line sympathise : Here. Warm your hands round the clay till words come back.
line reassure : Asking help doesn't set an automatic price on the asking.
line ack : Yes. That answer fits the question honestly.

scene pastimes_1
when topic=pastimes self.likes=riddles
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : What wears a lip above its foot, and sits quite happily on either?
b : Something from your shelf? | A creature that never stirs?
a : #rentcup#. Set it upside down once it's dry. Its mouth bears the weight just as well as its foot. | A clay cup will serve for such a creature if you can forgive the missing legs.

scene food_1
when topic=food self.likes=roast_pork
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I reserve #crackle# until the quietest bit of supper.
b : Is the sound half the pleasure? | Could anyone coax the final piece from you?
a : Plainly. There's little point in a fine rind if a whole table is talking through it. | If I had given my word. Otherwise the pleasure of the last bit is already spoken for.

scene family_1
when topic=family self.married=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I reserve the easy chair for #self.spouse#. No household account required.
b : Is that a special rule? | Would you mind the stool?
a : That's the ordinary rule. There'd be no rest at home if we charged each other for every small comfort. | Less than I'd mind attending a formal reckoning after every meal.

scene family_2
when topic=family self.parent=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I've a riddle to try on #self.child# when we have an empty cup between us.
b : What's the riddle? | Why wait for the empty cup?
a : Which debt grows smaller when you remember it? The helping hand you can return today. | I've learnt to turn the cup over at the answer. Twice I thought too far ahead of the drink.

scene day_1
when topic=day
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : My petition is adrift within the City Office. My weekly walk gives me time to ask what has a home and no known address.
b : Will a riddle bring it back? | Have you an answer yet?
a : No. So I put the question plainly when I arrive. The riddle is just company for the walk. | My missing petition, unfortunately. I hope that answer grows obsolete.

scene weather_1
when topic=weather self.likes=frosty_mornings
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Frost shows exactly where a warm cup rested.
b : How long does the mark last? | Can you tell which cup it was?
a : Until frost gathers again or the sun takes the rest. No sense expecting a permanent receipt from the weather. | By the breadth of the foot, sometimes. I should hesitate to call the cup to account on that evidence alone.

scene prices_1
when topic=prices
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A borrowed penny and a gifted penny look distressingly alike on the table.
b : What distinguishes the two pennies? | What if you forget?
a : Agree with the other hand before it lets go. An hour later is an expensive time to start explaining. | Ask the giver. Even an excellent memory is only one end of the arrangement.

scene times_1
when topic=times world.times=lean|hard
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I'd rather hear a neighbour ask for half a loaf now than discover a whole family hungry at dusk.
b : Is that loaf a loan? | Even an arrival you never met?
a : I say gift when I mean gift. Bread isn't improved by leaving somebody to guess which word I meant. | A hungry stomach doesn't need an introduction to bread.

scene animals_1
when topic=animals self.dislikes=flies
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Flies have a poor idea of whose bit of pork has already been allotted.
b : How do you explain it? | Do they come back?
a : With #flynet#. I don't attempt anything as subtle as a verbal argument. | Often. They find a principle of ownership less persuasive than the smell of roast.

scene home_1
when topic=home
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : An upright cup means something still owing. An overturned one means the account can sleep.
b : Suppose you're thirsty? | How many could you remember?
a : Keep the drinking cups elsewhere. A thirsty visitor once put my accounts into a surprising state. | Dusting limits my enthusiasm for a shelf full of accounts. Beyond that I settle the little matters before they breed.

scene faith_1
when topic=faith
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I can remember help without making anyone stand up and describe having once been hungry.
b : Isn't giving thanks enough? | Where does that memory live?
a : It does for the giver. It won't fill the next empty plate. Both hands will find plenty to do. | Near the bread. That's where it is likeliest to make itself practically useful.

scene friends_1
when topic=friends
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I don't charge interest on the time between one decent conversation and the next.
b : Could it be a debt at all? | How would you collect?
a : Only if I'd talked the ear off somebody and still owed the courtesy of listening. | By sitting still now and letting the other wolf choose the subject.

scene festivals_1
when topic=festival self.likes=festival_bells
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I like the one thin bell that stays in the ear after the heavier bells are done.
b : Does it really keep ringing? | Has the thin bell a name?
a : I can't swear to anything outside my own head. Inside there's usually one more note left over. | That's a fine riddle with no need of an answer before breakfast.

scene gossip_1
when topic=gossip here.gossip=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The claim is that #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I heard it. There's the extent of my share.
b : Would you pay to know more? | Could it be true?
a : I prefer my pennies to buy something for the table. | Certainly. It could equally spend a good long time beneath a cup marked uncertain.

story cupwater [topic=family]
  : I set a cup mouth downward to settle a debt of three windfallen apples.
  : The debt was indeed paid. The cup, however, still held half my drinking water.
  b : What did the water settle?
  : The dust on the shelf. I let the rest dry and moved the drinking things across the room.

story rindriddle [topic=food]
  : I asked what could make a noise behind closed lips. I bit down on some rind.
  : The answer went right on making itself heard after I'd given it.
  b : Did anybody have to guess?
  : I found a remarkably direct way of giving away the answer and getting my favourite part of supper eaten first.

story frostmouth [topic=weather]
  : I left my cup sideways on frosty stone and went in to warm my hands.
  : The round print I expected had turned into two small patches.
  b : Two cups?
  : One lip, one foot. A well-made cup can tell its own riddle given a cold stone to lie on.

rule @debt
when concept=bark
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Gift or loan. Say it while both hands are there. | No tally needed for a second helping.

rule @bell
when concept=bark self.likes=festival_bells
does aside
cooldown 8h
say The thin note stayed after the others. | A whole street can share the same ringing.

rule @pork
when concept=bark self.likes=roast_pork
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Save the crackle till supper grows quiet. | A cover before the flies make up their minds.

rule @dawn
when concept=bark here.time=dawn
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Two clear prints on the frost this morning. | Cup on its side again, if I'm any judge.
dlg resident.hub : There's an easy question under this cup unless you've brought a harder one.
dlg resident.job : I've a head for who owes whom. A household supplies me with plenty of little things to remember.
dlg resident.news [world.news] : This much I can lay before you with an easy conscience. #world.news#.
dlg resident.gossip [here.gossip=yes] : The version on the table is #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I wouldn't lend it my signature.
dlg resident.bye : Go easy. No charge for the riddles.

graft resident.hub
choice Why is one cup overturned? -> old_cup
node old_cup
say I lent something and got it back. The overturned cup reminds me to quit remembering a neighbour as owing me anything.
choice Then why keep the cup there? -> clean_cup
choice That settles my question. -> hub
node clean_cup
say It stops me opening the same account again in my head. Tomorrow I'll give the shelf a wipe and use the cup for a drink.
choice That settles my question. -> hub

old

line answer.how : Old enough to value a riddle which can be answered sitting down.
line farewell [here.time=dusk] : My knees are voting for home. May yours be agreeable.

scene memories_1
when topic=memories
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : In youth I could remember a debt without remembering when it ceased. That kind of memory needs a little improving.
b : How did you improve it? | Can a gift last longer?
a : I gave the settled account a gesture as plain as lending the first penny. That's where my upside-down cups began. | A gift lasts very well in a memory. You can keep the good taste without keeping a sum.

scene health_1
when topic=health
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The opening festival bell sounds better from somewhere an old back can lean.
b : Why the first one? | Can you lean on a friend?
a : Because I like hearing the quiet change into a holiday. Later the ear already knows what sort of a day it is. | With permission. Friendship is no warrant for dropping a whole solid wolf on an unsuspecting shoulder.

scene smalltalk_1
when topic=smalltalk
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I sometimes forget the words of an old riddle and remember the answer warm in my hand.
b : What answer weighs so little? | Can you work back from it?
a : A cup, a crust or a bit of bone. The best answers fit the pocket comfortably. | It's how I occasionally arrive at an entirely fresh question. No law against an answer earning its keep twice.

scene travel_1
when topic=travel
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Nowadays I go uphill by the route with a broad sill halfway along.
b : Do you sit on it? | What if someone needs to pass?
a : For a moment, if welcomed. A dry sill and an easy breath put quite a different face on the remaining climb. | I leave the way wide enough. A resting wolf oughtn't become another difficulty on somebody else's road.
